Second, the platform code, method registry, evaluation scripts, and intent definitions will be deposited in a public repository with an archived DOI upon acceptance, so that the evaluation can be independently inspected and rerun. A Code availability statement has been added to the revised manuscript: the platform source code and the evaluation materials (intent set, method registry, and scoring scripts) are available from the corresponding author upon reasonable request and will be deposited in a public repository upon acceptance.
}

